                                "sense_id": "ded7a6fa-4856-34c0-a14d-aab8095467fd",
                                "text": "The Supreme Court on Thursday ruled that much of eastern Oklahoma falls within an Indian reservation, a decision that could reshape the criminal justice system by preventing state authorities from prosecuting offenses there that involve Native Americans."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
